  "texts": [
    "Implemented the fix in `peekable._get_slice`.\n\n### Change\nNegative-step slices with an omitted `stop` no longer fall into the “cache the entire iterable” branch. For a non-negative `start`, caching now stops at `start + 1`, which is sufficient for reverse slicing.\n\n### Verification\n- Public test suite: `620 passed, 11318 subtests passed`\n- Patch submitted successfully."
